DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       ppffmmttooppaamm reads a PFM (Portable Float Map) image and converts it to PAM.

       See ppaammttooppffmm(1) for a description of PFM.

       If  you  want  one  of the older, more portable Netpbm formats, run the
       output through ppaammttooppnnmm.

       ppaammttooppffmm creates a PAM with tuple type "RGB" or  "GRAYSCALE"  depending
       on whether or not the PFM is in the color subformat.

       Use ppaammttooppffmm(1) to convert a PFM image to Netpbm format.



